[SIZE="4"]Beyond Ordinary!
[B][I]GenesisOS[/I][/B] is a custom ROM based on AOSP with nifty little Quality of Life features to enhance your daily driving experience.[/SIZE]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GenesisOS/Website-Data/refs/heads/v2/xda/assets/Features.png[/IMG]

[SIZE="4"][B]Full Features List [I][URL="https://GenesisOS.dev/features"][COLOR=rgb(120, 235, 66)]Click Here![/COLOR][/URL][/B][/I][/SIZE]

[IMG]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/GenesisOS/Website-Data/refs/heads/v2/xda/assets/Flashing.png[/IMG]

[SIZE="6"][B][I]First Time Install/Clean Flash[/I][/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE="4"][B][COLOR=rgb(255, 94, 94)]Warning:[/COLOR] Take Full Backup of your Internal Storage[/B]
- Reboot to Fastboot
- Flash boot and vendorboot image
- Reboot to Recovery Mode
- Go to Factory Reset > Format data/factory reset > Factory Reset [B][This will Format the Internal Storage][/B]
- Now go to Apply update > Apply from ADB > adb sideload romfile.zip 
- Reboot to System[/SIZE]

[SIZE="6"][B][I]Update/Dirty Flash[/I][/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE="4"]Use Our [I][B][COLOR=rgb(120, 235, 66)]Inbuilt Updater[/COLOR][/I][/B]
OR
- Reboot to Recovery Mode
- Go to Apply update > Apply from ADB > adb sideload romfile.zip
- Reboot to System [/SIZE]

